# OmniRoute UI & Code Standards

- **Ant Design Component Sizing**:
  All Ant Design components (Buttons, Inputs, Select, Segmented, Form Controls) must use the default size (`middle` / default). NEVER configure `size="small"` on buttons, segmented controls, or input fields.

- **Data Sourcing**:
  Always connect to real SQLite DB and official BFF Fastify endpoints. Never introduce fake mock fallback seeds.

- **Internationalization (i18n)**:
  Always use `useI18n()` with `tt("中文", "English")` for UI texts and titles.
